---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact FormSetu">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">Contact</h1>

  <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:contact@formsetu.com" class="font-semibold text-navy-700 underline">contact@formsetu.com</a>. We read everything and usually reply within a couple of days.</p>

    <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-navy-900">Especially useful to hear about</h2>
      <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5">
        <li>A specification on our site that does not match the official notification</li>
        <li>An exam you need that we have not added yet</li>
        <li>A tool that did not work on your device</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p>If you are reporting an incorrect specification, please include the exam name and a link to the official notification. That helps us fix it the same day.</p>

    <p class="text-muted">We cannot help with the application itself, exam results, or anything requiring access to your portal account. For those, contact the examination authority directly.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>